<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-463] Intermittent failures in Interpreter, stalled web UI. </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-463</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;On running a paragraph, if the output contains say more than 20,000 rows, the web UI kind of freezes for a while, and even after rendering the table the scroll of table works very slow.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12916100">ZEPPELIN-463</key>
            <summary>Intermittent failures in Interpreter, stalled web UI. </summary>
